    <string name="about_privacy_title">🔒 Privacy First</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Watermark Remover Studio processes everything locally on your device. No images are ever uploaded, no account is required, and no data is stored outside your phone. Your photos stay yours.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">✨ Features</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">• Brush-based watermark masking\n• Paint and erase mode\n• Adjustable brush size and cleanup strength\n• Undo / redo edit history\n• Zoom, pan, and fit-to-view controls\n• Live before/after compare slider\n• One-tap healing fill\n• PNG export to device gallery</string>
    <string name="about_tech_title">⚙ How It Works</string>
    <string name="about_tech_body">Paint a mask over the watermark area, then tap Clean Up. The engine expands the mask slightly to catch edge pixels, then fills the selected region outside-in using nearby unmasked pixel colors. For small corner watermarks, this is typically instant.</string>

